<title>ITALY: Palermo air cargo traffic down 23pct in January.</title>
<headline>Palermo air cargo traffic down 23pct in January.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Palermo airport operator GESAP said total air cargo traffic, including mail, handled in January totalled 371 tonnes, down 23 percentpct on the same period 1996.</p>
<p>Traffic details in tonnes include:</p>
<p>				 Jan 97    Jan 96</p>
<p> Total Traffic		371	 484</p>
<p> Inwards			201	 269</p>
<p> Outwards		     168	 215</p>
<p> Transit Cargo		  2	   -</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
</text>
